{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "scene": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "orientation": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "landscape",
        "portrait",
        "square"
      ]
    },
    "palette": {
      "type": "array",
      "description": "Exactly N distinct Darl'Art IDs, largest area first",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "4-digit Darl'Art ID, e.g. 0105"
          },
          "use": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Where the color goes"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "use"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "scene",
    "orientation",
    "palette"
  ]
}

parameters.text:
Check the attached image.
clean = false if it contains ANY of these:
- a color palette, color swatches, color chips, a color bar or strip, or a legend;
- any text, letters, numbers, labels, logo, signature or watermark;
- a border, frame, white margin, mockup, canvas edge or paper around the painting;
- a pixel-art, blocky or mosaic look (visible square pixels or blocks).
Otherwise clean = true. "problems" lists what you found, or is empty.

